WHAT THIS REPOSITORY'S OWN CHECKS DEPEND ON
-------------------------------------------

  shellcheck                      GPL-3.0-or-later
    github.com/koalaman/shellcheck. Invoked as an external program by
    `make lint`, never linked or distributed. Optional: without it the shell
    scripts are still parsed, just not linted.

  python3                         Python Software Foundation License
    Invoked by `make config` to validate the example configuration files, using
    only the standard library. There is no Python source code in this
    repository. `make config` exits 2 rather than reporting a pass when python3
    is absent.

scripts/doctor.sh and scripts/link-check.sh are POSIX shell and require no
interpreter beyond the shell and curl, deliberately: a broken Python must not be
able to stop you diagnosing a broken Python. See
docs/DECISIONS/0004-posix-sh-for-diagnostics.md.


THE ILLUSTRATIONS
-----------------

The images in docs/assets/img/ and in the README were generated with an
image model and are decorative. They contain no third-party brand asset and no
reproduced artwork. docs/assets/img/README.md records how they were made and the
rule they are held to: every point an image illustrates is also made in prose, a
table or a diagram on the same page, so nothing is load-bearing on an image.
